        "Jesus did miracles and changed lives, and Jews of his time called him a prophet. John 9:16: “How can a sinner do such signs?” Miracles are the seal of a true messenger.",
        "Deuteronomy 13:1-6 says that a prophet whose sign comes true, but who leads Israel after other gods, is to be rejected, because God is testing Israel. Signs do not settle truth, and changed lives occur in every religion.",
        "Deuteronomy 13: miracles do not validate",
